<title>HONG KONG: Lei Shing Hong 1996 net rises 12.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Lei Shing Hong 1996 net rises 12.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   29.9     vs 26.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    6.0	vs 6.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs 39.34 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    153.82   vs 136.35</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,780.17 vs 1,156.39</p>
<p>    Company name		 Lei Shing Hong Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  May 19-26</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 16</p>
<p>NOTE - Lei Shing Hong is a shipping and property investment firm.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is six H.K. cents vs same.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
